[{"id":"MzU-q01","number":1,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Jika&nbsp;<img title=\"\\left \\lfloor x \\right \\rfloor\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\left&amp;space;\\lfloor&amp;space;x&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;\\rfloor\" />&nbsp;menyatakan bilangan bulat terbesar yang lebih kecil atau sama dengan bilangan real x, maka&nbsp;<img title=\"\\left \\lfloor \\sqrt{3}-\\sqrt{5} \\right \\rfloor^{2}=\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\left&amp;space;\\lfloor&amp;space;\\sqrt{3}-\\sqrt{5}&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;\\rfloor^{2}=\" /></p>","choices":["-1","0","1","9","81"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTUzNA"},{"id":"MzU-q02","number":2,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Bilangan&nbsp;<img title=\"\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt{5}+2} -\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt{5}-2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt{5}+2}&amp;space;-\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt{5}-2}\" />&nbsp;merupakan bilangan .....</p>","choices":["bulat&nbsp;negatif","bulat positif","pecahan","Irrasional positif","Irrasional negatif"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTYzNA"},{"id":"MzU-q03","number":3,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Banyaknya soal yang dikerjakan Amin hari ini bertambah cepat 40% dibandingkan dengan yang dikerjakannya kemarin. Banyaknya soal yang dikerjakan Amin hari ini paling sedikit ada&hellip;</p>","choices":["5","6","7","8","tidak bisa ditentukan"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTYzNQ"},{"id":"MzU-q04","number":4,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Misalkan H adalah himpunan semua faktor positif dari 2007. Banyaknya himpunan bagian dari H yang tidak kosong adalah &hellip;.</p>","choices":["6","31","32","63","64"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTYzNg"},{"id":"MzU-q05","number":5,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Misalkan N sebuah bilangan asli dua-angka dan M adalah bilangan asli yang diperoleh dengan mempertukarkan kedua angka N. Bilangan prima yang selalu habis membagi N-M adalah&hellip;.</p>","choices":["2","3","7","9","11"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTYzNw"},{"id":"MzU-q06","number":6,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Sebuah sample diperoleh dari 5 pengamatan. Jika rataan hitung (mean) sample sama dengan 10 dan median sampel sama dengan 12, maka nilai terkecil jangkauan sample sama dengan&hellip;</p>","choices":["2","3","5","7","10"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTYzOA"},{"id":"MzU-q07","number":7,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Peluang menemukan di antara 3 orang ada paling sedikit 2 orang yang lahir dalam bulan yang sama adalah .....</p>","choices":["&nbsp;&nbsp;<img title=\"\\frac{17}{72}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\frac{17}{72}\" />","&nbsp;&nbsp;<img title=\"\\frac{33}{72}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\frac{33}{72}\" />","&nbsp;&nbsp;<img title=\"\\frac{39}{72}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\frac{39}{72}\" />","&nbsp;&nbsp;<img title=\"\\frac{48}{72}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\frac{48}{72}\" />","&nbsp;&nbsp;<img title=\"\\frac{55}{72}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\frac{55}{72}\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTYzOQ"},{"id":"MzU-q08","number":8,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Keliling sebuah segitiga adalah 8.Jika panjang sisi-sisinya adalah bilangan bulat,maka&nbsp; luas segitiga tersebut sama dengan &hellip;..</p>","choices":["&nbsp;&nbsp;<img title=\"2\\sqrt{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?2\\sqrt{2}\" />","&nbsp;&nbsp;<img title=\"\\frac{16\\sqrt{3}}{9}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\frac{16\\sqrt{3}}{9}\" />","&nbsp;&nbsp;<img title=\"2\\sqrt{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?2\\sqrt{3}\" />","&nbsp;&nbsp;<img title=\"4\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?4\" />","&nbsp;&nbsp;<img title=\"4\\sqrt{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?4\\sqrt{2}\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTY0MA"},{"id":"MzU-q09","number":9,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Sepotong kawat dipotong menjadi 2 bagian, dengan perbandingan panjang 3:2. Masing- masing bagian kemudian dibentuk menjadi sebuah persegi.Perbandingan luas kedua persegi adalah&hellip;</p>","choices":["4:3","3:2","5:3","9:4","5:2"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTY0MQ"},{"id":"MzU-q10","number":10,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<div><p align=\"left\">Untuk setiap bilangan real x berlaku <img title=\"\\small \\dpi{100} \\fn_cm \\small \\fn_cm \\fn_cm \\frac{Tan^{2}x+Cos^{2}x}{Sin\\: x+Sec\\: x}=\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\fn_cm&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;\\dpi{100}&amp;space;\\fn_cm&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;\\fn_cm&amp;space;\\fn_cm&amp;space;\\frac{Tan^{2}x+Cos^{2}x}{Sin\\:&amp;space;x+Sec\\:&amp;space;x}=\" />&nbsp;.....</p>","choices":["Sec x + Sin x","Sec x - Sin x","Cos x + Csc x","Cos x - Csc x","Cos x + Sin x</p></div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTY0Mg"},{"id":"MzU-q11","number":11,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Misalkan f(x) = 2x-1, dan g(x) =&nbsp;<img title=\"\\small \\sqrt{x}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\fn_cm&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;\\sqrt{x}\" />. Jika f(g(x)) = 3, maka x = .....</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTY0Mw"},{"id":"MzU-q12","number":12,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Pengepakan buah &ldquo;Drosophila&rdquo; akan mengemas 44 apel ke dalam beberapa kotak. Ada 2 jenis kotak yang tersedia, yaitu kotak untuk 10 apel dan kotak untuk 6 apel. Banyak kotak yang diperlukan adalah .....</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTY0NA"},{"id":"MzU-q13","number":13,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" align=\"left\">Semua pasangan bilangan bulat (x,y) yang memenuhi x + y = xy - 1 dan&nbsp; x &le; y adalah &hellip;..</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTY0NQ"},{"id":"MzU-q14","number":14,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-right: 21.85pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 41.0pt;\">Jika n adalah bilangan asli sehingga 3<sup>n</sup> adalah faktor dari 33!, maka nilai n terbesar yang mungkin adalah ..&hellip;</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTY0Ng"},{"id":"MzU-q15","number":15,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<div class=\"WordSection1\"><p align=\"left\">Sebuah ruas garis mulai dari titik&nbsp;<img title=\"(3,2\\frac{1}{5})\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?(3,2\\frac{1}{5})\" />&nbsp;dan&nbsp;berakhir di&nbsp;<img title=\"(99,68\\frac{3}{5})\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?(99,68\\frac{3}{5})\" />&nbsp;Banyaknya titik dengan koordinat bilangan bulat yang dilalui garis tersebut adalah &hellip;..</p></div>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTY0Nw"},{"id":"MzU-q16","number":16,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-right: 21.65pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 41.0pt;\">Pada segitiga PQR sama sisi diberikan titik-titik S dan T yang terletak berturut-turut pada sisi QR dan PR demikian rupa, sehingga sudut SPR = 40<sup>0</sup> dan sudut TQR = 35<sup>0</sup>. Jika titik X adalah perpotongan garis-garis PS dan QT,maka sudut SXT = &hellip;.</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTY0OA"},{"id":"MzU-q17","number":17,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Pada segitiga ABC yang siku-siku di C, AE dan BF adalah garis-garis berat(median).</p><p>Maka <img title=\"\\small \\small | \\frac{\\left | AE \\right |^{2}+\\left | BF \\right |^{2}}{\\left | AB \\right |^{2}}=\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\small&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;|&amp;space;\\frac{\\left&amp;space;|&amp;space;AE&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;|^{2}+\\left&amp;space;|&amp;space;BF&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;|^{2}}{\\left&amp;space;|&amp;space;AB&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;|^{2}}=\" />&nbsp;.....</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTY0OQ"},{"id":"MzU-q18","number":18,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Diketahui 4 titik pada bidang dengan koordinat A(1, 0), B(2008, 2007), C(2007, 2007), D(0, 0). Luas jajaran genjang ABCD sama dengan&hellip;.</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTY1MA"},{"id":"MzU-q19","number":19,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-right: 21.7pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 41.0pt;\">Sebuah lingkaran berjari-jari 1. Luas maksimal segitiga sama sisi yang dapat dimuat di dalam lingkaran adalah&hellip;.</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTY1MQ"},{"id":"MzU-q20","number":20,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Sebuah daerah persegi dibagi menjadi 2007 daerah kecil dengan menarik garis-garis lurus yang menghubungkan 2 sisi berbeda pada persegi. Banyak garis lurus yang harus ditarik paling sedikit ada ....</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTY1Mg"}]
